      "condition": 5,
      "evidence": "隔離control4case1374assert/exit0、double往復/先頭plus許容/ID overflow拒否除去/unsigned index上限拒否除去の4変異は各compile/link0かつassertion exit42。35入力前後hash一致、全5mapsで元archive producer未抽出、専用producerの両作用を確認。"
